{
    "title": "Project Match3",
    "description": "\u2728 Project Match 3, an immersive and joyful matching game! \u2728\r\nProject Match 3 is an immersive and fun matching game that takes you on a mysterious and exciting adventure world!\r\n\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\r\nIn this world, you need to collect buttons to earn coins through levels. After successfully completing a level, you will have the opportunity to unlock super rewards and become the top champion in the design world.\r\nNow, accept the invitation of Project Match 3 and start an immersive and exciting adventure!\r\nGameplay is simple:\r\n\ud83d\udd39 Arrange 3 or more identical buttons together to eliminate them.\r\n\ud83d\udd39 When you arrange 4 buttons in a row, a special rocket will be created. The special rocket can eliminate the buttons in a whole row or column.\r\n\ud83d\udd39 When you match 5 T-shaped or L-shaped buttons, a bomb will be created. The bomb can eliminate all the surrounding buttons.\r\n\ud83d\udd39 When you match 5 buttons in a line, a rotating button will be created. The rotating gem can eliminate all the buttons it selects.\r\n\ud83d\udd39 By combining 2 special buttons, you will create various magical effects to help you pass the level smoothly.\r\n\ud83d\udd39 As long as you eliminate all obstacles in the level and reach the goal, you can keep moving forward.\r\nFeatures of Project Match 3:\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Diversified game modes. Three different elimination game modes for you to choose from.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Treasure Levels. Complete time-limited challenges to unlock super treasures.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Daily free gifts. Provide surprise gifts every day to make you happier.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Collect stars. After perfecting a level, you will receive rich rewards.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Easy and fun. Relaxing and challenging at the same time.\r\nA simple and fun game experience:\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Simple controls, enjoyable gameplay, and beautiful interface!\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Just tap the screen to swap gems!\r\nNo internet? No problem!\r\n\u2728 This game is completely free and can be played offline at any time.\r\nProject Match 3 is a popular matching game in the app store. It is unique, simple, fun, and challenging. After completing level challenges, you will receive star rewards. These stars can be used to collect valuable treasures.\r\nThis is the perfect matching game for you. It is completely free, but some in-game items require payment, such as purchasing extra steps and super props.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Eliminate 3 buttons, endless fun! We look forward to your participation! \ud83c\udf1f",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2728 Project Match 3, an immersive and joyful matching game! \u2728<br>Project Match 3 is an immersive and fun matching game that takes you on a mysterious and exciting adventure world!<br>\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e\ud83d\udd2e<br>In this world, you need to collect buttons to earn coins through levels. After successfully completing a level, you will have the opportunity to unlock super rewards and become the top champion in the design world.<br>Now, accept the invitation of Project Match 3 and start an immersive and exciting adventure!<br>Gameplay is simple:<br>\ud83d\udd39 Arrange 3 or more identical buttons together to eliminate them.<br>\ud83d\udd39 When you arrange 4 buttons in a row, a special rocket will be created. The special rocket can eliminate the buttons in a whole row or column.<br>\ud83d\udd39 When you match 5 T-shaped or L-shaped buttons, a bomb will be created. The bomb can eliminate all the surrounding buttons.<br>\ud83d\udd39 When you match 5 buttons in a line, a rotating button will be created. The rotating gem can eliminate all the buttons it selects.<br>\ud83d\udd39 By combining 2 special buttons, you will create various magical effects to help you pass the level smoothly.<br>\ud83d\udd39 As long as you eliminate all obstacles in the level and reach the goal, you can keep moving forward.<br>Features of Project Match 3:<br>\ud83d\udc8e Diversified game modes. Three different elimination game modes for you to choose from.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Treasure Levels. Complete time-limited challenges to unlock super treasures.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Daily free gifts. Provide surprise gifts every day to make you happier.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Collect stars. After perfecting a level, you will receive rich rewards.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Easy and fun. Relaxing and challenging at the same time.<br>A simple and fun game experience:<br>\ud83d\udca1 Simple controls, enjoyable gameplay, and beautiful interface!<br>\ud83d\udca1 Just tap the screen to swap gems!<br>No internet? No problem!<br>\u2728 This game is completely free and can be played offline at any time.<br>Project Match 3 is a popular matching game in the app store. It is unique, simple, fun, and challenging. After completing level challenges, you will receive star rewards. These stars can be used to collect valuable treasures.<br>This is the perfect matching game for you. It is completely free, but some in-game items require payment, such as purchasing extra steps and super props.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Eliminate 3 buttons, endless fun! We look forward to your participation! \ud83c\udf1f",
